cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the underlying data resources when using this work."
type: software
title: "Material similarity from incomplete composition and synthesis metadata"
version: 0.2.2
authors:
  - family-names: Kaneko
    given-names: Hiromasa
    affiliation: Meiji University
abstract: >-
  Python implementation and frozen research data for target-free material
  comparison using composition, constituent identity, synthesis method,
  operation types, ordered and repeated operations, and process settings.
  Missing settings are not imputed. Multiple explicit weight profiles return
  conditional distance bounds and support clustering and neighbor retrieval.
keywords:
  - materials informatics
  - material similarity
  - synthesis metadata
  - unsupervised learning
  - incomplete reporting
